   "section": "mod-tome/data/zones/norgos-lair/npcs.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "This ancient bear long guarded the western side of the forest, but as of late he started growing mad, attacking even the Thaloren.\nIt seems to have fallen prey to the shivgoroth invading the area. Dead and frozen, it seems like a statue, animated by the elementals.",
   "target": "这只远古巨熊长久以来守护着森林的西侧，但最近他开始变得疯狂，甚至连自然精灵都会攻击。\n它似乎已沦为入侵此地的西弗格罗斯的猎物。它已死去并被冻结，看上去像一座雕像，由那些元素生物驱动着。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/zones/norgos-lair/npcs.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
