   "args_order": null,
   "source": "This small orc has a malicious and greedy look in its eyes. Its veins pulse with new life and it moves with surprising speed. Though not fully developed you can still see the muscles forming on its long limbs, leading to clawed fingers and toes.",
   "target": "这只小兽人的眼里透露着怨恨和贪婪。它有着旺盛的活力并能以惊人的速度移动。虽然还没完全长大，但是你仍能看到他修长四肢上正在成形的肌肉，末端连着带爪的手指和脚趾。",
